The adelic reconstruction theorem of Balchin and Greenlees \cite{balchingreenlees_adelic1}, applied to the derived category $\cat D(\cat O)$ of $\cat O$-modules, shows that \eqref{eq:fracturesquare} categorifies to a pullback square of symmetric monoidal $\infty$-categories\footnote{To be precise, Balchin and Greenlees work in the context of monoidal model categories. Passing to the underlying symmetric monoidal $\infty$-categories via \cite[\S4.1.7]{HALurie} results in the pullback square of \eqref{eq:derfracturesquare}.}
